<title>UK: DSL Bank adds 100 billion lire to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank adds 100 billion lire to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSL Bank Deutsche Siedlungs-und Landesrentenbank has added 100 billion lire, priced at 100.90, to its 8.00 percent Eurobond due November 2006, joint lead managers San Paolo and BNP said.  </p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT   *100 BLN LIRE  COUPON     8.00	MATURITY    13.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.90    PAY DATE    13.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/=     DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMS US/UK/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> NOTES     *TOTAL SIZE IS NOW 400 BLN LIRE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
